              "sense": "2",
              "turoyo": "u=kaǧ w-u=ḥīt-ano me ʕal ḥaṣe d-aʕ=ʕeze ko-qayṣina-le w-ʕamro-ste me ʕal ḥaṣe d-aʕ-ʕwone ko-qayṣina-le",
              "translation": "We shore long and curly goat’s hair off of the backs of the goats and we shore wool off of the backs of the sheep",
